#
# This corrects the SCAN, not the price: the session-log walk misses turns
# (v1/v2-engine turns that only reach SQLite, interrupted turns whose
# usage_summary never landed, sessions outside KIRO_SESSIONS). FINDINGS.md
# accounts for ~0.4% of the gap; the rest is unexplained, so this is an
# empirical correction, not a modelled one.
#
# Re-measure with `--verify-credits`, which prints the current scan against a
# `/usage` figure you pass in. Caveat on the anchor below: the period start is
# assumed to be calendar-month (reset is 2026-09-01); if the period actually
# began later, the true gap is larger.
